<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 8,517 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 5,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  166   (161 and 149)</p>
<p>    Good		152   (152 and 135)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     144   (144 and 122)</p>
<p>    Medium	    137   (137 and 105)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	105   (unq and  80)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 166 pence for an Kenya PF.1 and Rwanda PD.</p>
</text>
